WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:06.923
[Piojo laughs]

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.008
[Jesus laughs]

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:10.427
Hey, mira, another pig!

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.347
Hey, pull down your pants, pig!
Show us your curly little--

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:16.850
[gasps]

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:21.146
Piojo!

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:51.092
Shh.

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.635
[Jesus grunts]

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:56.681
-[grunts]
-[cop] Come on, big guy.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.641
[Jesus whimpers]

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:00.810
Try something.

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.191
[Garcia] What's going on?

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:14.032
[grunts]

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:16.409
[grunts]

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.087
[barking]

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:29.089
LOCAL POLICE STATION
PRECINCT 13

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.132
[grunts]

00:01:41.851 --> 00:01:43.269
[gunfire continues]

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.858
[gunfire stops]

00:01:58.701 --> 00:01:59.869
[gun clicks]

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:02.038
[grunting]

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:11.798
[gunshot]

00:02:12.715 --> 00:02:14.175
-[gasps]
-[grunts]

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.086
[two gunshots]

00:02:51.421 --> 00:02:53.006
[cop grunting]

00:02:55.758 --> 00:02:56.593
[gasps]

00:02:58.928 --> 00:02:59.929
[gasps]

00:03:03.224 --> 00:03:04.601
[cop whimpers]

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:06.853
[gasps]

00:03:10.607 --> 00:03:11.608
[grunts]

00:03:15.195 --> 00:03:17.197
[Isabela panting]

00:03:20.783 --> 00:03:21.784
[sighs]

00:03:21.826 --> 00:03:22.952
[handcuffs creaking]

00:03:22.994 --> 00:03:24.120
[grunts]

00:03:27.165 --> 00:03:28.166
[door opens]

00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:30.335
[gasps]

00:03:33.129 --> 00:03:35.048
Why the hell is he in your cell?

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:38.051
Um...

00:03:38.134 --> 00:03:39.135
[Jesus sighs]

00:03:40.136 --> 00:03:41.804
[Piojo grunting]

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:43.806
[cell door opening]

00:03:48.144 --> 00:03:49.145
He'll live.

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:51.648
Get me gauze,
and stay away from the windows.

